@startuml
' Report 4: 3.8.2.2
title FE-29 - Manage Inventory Items and Low-Stock Threshold Alerts
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 170
skinparam ParticipantPadding 16
skinparam sequence {
 ArrowColor #202020
 LifeLineBorderColor #777777
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor #202020
 ActorBackgroundColor white
 ActorBorderColor #202020
 ActivationBackgroundColor white
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor #444444
 ReferenceBackgroundColor white
}
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFFF0
skinparam NoteBorderColor #777777
actor "Farm Manager" as U
participant "SSFM Interface" as UI
caption Existing + proposed extension - target design, not a claim of complete implementation
U -> UI : 1. Choose an action
activate UI
UI -->> U : 2. Show the selected form or view
deactivate UI
alt 2.1 Create item
' ref-target: FE-29-CREATE
ref over U,UI : 2.1.1. Create inventory and check low stock\n(FE-29-CREATE)
else 2.2 Edit item or threshold
' ref-target: FE-29-UPDATE
ref over U,UI : 2.2.1. Update inventory and check low stock\n(FE-29-UPDATE)
else 2.3 Delete item
' ref-target: FE-29-DELETE
ref over U,UI : 2.3.1. Delete inventory item\n(FE-29-DELETE)
end
' Source references:

@enduml
